body:
Indeed, to work on a non-primary screen, this should be `screen_get_size(SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS)` to get the screen with the mouse cursor. And also use `screen_get_position(SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS)`, like:

```c++
Size2i screen_size = ds->screen_get_size(DisplayServer::SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS);
Vector2i screen_pos = ds->screen_get_position(DisplayServer::SCREEN_WITH_MOUSE_FOCUS);

float offset_decal_x = (offset.x < screen_pos.x + screen_size.width / 2) ? 8 : -36;
float offset_decal_y = (offset.y < screen_pos.y + screen_size.height / 2) ? 8 : -36;
picker_window->set_position(offset + Vector2(offset_decal_x, offset_decal_y));
```

